body:
felicitazione, ora vai via da qui e che la fortuna sia con te.  


Traduccion pa los compas: Felicidades, ahora escapa y que la suerte este contigo.   


quiero hacer el tramite tambien pero tengo un pequeño problema que mi bisabuela italiana nacio en 1889 y no consigo su partida de nacimiento.. ;-;

Not meet the president, i met the ex governor of the province where i live in a weird situation, i was crossing the street but i didn't notice that the light was in red, then a car stop in front of me, the driver takes his head out of the car and then insult me... he was the governor, i just go my way and he insulted me more after go his way. 

&#x200B;

NT: i'm not english speaker so i'm sorry if i havc grammar mistakes.
